"\n<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9.5 14.5l5-5M8 10l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 5 5L13 15M16 14l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-5-5L11 9\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Lektion</div><div class=\"lk-big\">27</div><h1>시간의 종속절</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Temporale Nebensätze</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">'~⁠했을 때', '~⁠하는 동안', '~⁠하기 전에'처럼 시간을 나타내는 종속절이에요.<br>어순은 20과와 같아요 — 접속사 맨 앞, 활용된 동사 맨 끝.<br>이 과에서는 als와 wenn의 구별, während·bevor·nachdem·seit·bis·sobald·solange의 뜻, 그리고 같은 뜻의 전치사·접속부사와의 차이를 정리해요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 과에서 익힐 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">과거의 한 번은 als, 되풀이와 현재·미래는 wenn으로 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">während·bevor·nachdem·seit·bis·sobald·solange를 뜻에 맞게 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">nachdem과 seit의 시제를 맞춰요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">vor/bevor/vorher처럼 전치사·접속사·접속부사를 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">wann·wenn·als를 구별해요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">복습</span><span class=\"sub-title\">18–20과 복습</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich bleibe zu Hause, weil ____. <span class=\"qh\">아파서</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) bin ich krank</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) krank ich bin</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ich bin krank</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) ich krank bin</button></div><div class=\"qe\">종속절 → 동사 끝 (20과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Wenn ich Zeit habe, ____. <span class=\"qh\">너를 도울게</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) helfe ich dir</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) dir ich helfe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ich dir helfe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ich helfe dir</button></div><div class=\"qe\">종속절이 첫 자리 → 동사, 동사 (20과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Weißt du, ____? <span class=\"qh\">그가 어디 사는지</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) er wo wohnt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) wo er wohnt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) wo wohnt er</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ob er wohnt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">간접의문문 → 동사 끝 (20과).</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Ich habe Angst ____ dem Hund.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) vor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) für</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) über</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) von</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Angst haben vor + 3격 (18과).</div></div></div>\n<section id=\"sec-A\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">A</span><h2>한국어로 먼저 보기</h2></div><p>한국어 '-ㄹ 때'는 쓰임이 넓어요 — '어렸을 때', '집에 왔을 때', '비가 올 때마다', '베를린에 가면'.<br>독일어는 이것을 als와 wenn으로 나눠요.<br>과거에 딱 한 번 있었던 일(또는 한 시기)이면 als, 그 밖의 모든 경우는 wenn이에요.</p><div class=\"dgm\"><div class=\"dgm-cap\">'-ㄹ 때' 하나를 als와 wenn으로 나눠요</div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>한국어</th><th>독일어</th><th>기준</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>어렸을 때</td><td><strong>Als</strong> ich ein Kind war, …</td><td>과거의 한 시기 → als</td></tr><tr><td>어제 집에 왔을 때</td><td><strong>Als</strong> ich gestern nach Hause kam, …</td><td>과거의 한 번 → als</td></tr><tr><td>집에 올 때마다</td><td><strong>Wenn</strong> ich nach Hause komme, …</td><td>되풀이 → wenn</td></tr><tr><td>베를린에 가면</td><td><strong>Wenn</strong> ich in Berlin bin, …</td><td>미래 → wenn</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-B\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">B</span><h2>als냐 wenn이냐</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">지난 일 한 번은 als, 되풀이되는 일과 앞으로의 일은 wenn이에요 — <strong>Als</strong> ich Kind war, … · <strong>Wenn</strong> ich Zeit habe, …</p></div></div><figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"fig-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"als는 지난 일 한 번, wenn은 되풀이되는 일과 지금·앞으로의 일\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"als_wenn-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mki\"/></marker><marker id=\"als_wenn-acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mka\"/></marker><marker id=\"als_wenn-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mko\"/></marker><marker id=\"als_wenn-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkn\"/></marker><marker id=\"als_wenn-w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkw\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"468.0\" y1=\"30.0\" x2=\"468.0\" y2=\"204.0\" class=\"f-la\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\"/><text x=\"468.0\" y=\"22.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">지금</text><text x=\"14.0\" y=\"64.0\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">als</text><text x=\"14.0\" y=\"84.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\">과거에 한 번</text><line x1=\"196.0\" y1=\"66.0\" x2=\"584.0\" y2=\"66.0\" class=\"f-ln\" marker-end=\"url(#als_wenn-ink)\"/><circle cx=\"300.0\" cy=\"66.0\" r=\"8.0\" class=\"f-fa\"/><text x=\"14.0\" y=\"126.0\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">wenn</text><text x=\"14.0\" y=\"146.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\">여러 번 되풀이</text><line x1=\"196.0\" y1=\"128.0\" x2=\"584.0\" y2=\"128.0\" class=\"f-ln\" marker-end=\"url(#als_wenn-ink)\"/><circle cx=\"236.0\" cy=\"128.0\" r=\"8.0\" class=\"f-fok\"/><circle cx=\"280.0\" cy=\"128.0\" r=\"8.0\" class=\"f-fok\"/><circle cx=\"324.0\" cy=\"128.0\" r=\"8.0\" class=\"f-fok\"/><circle cx=\"368.0\" cy=\"128.0\" r=\"8.0\" class=\"f-fok\"/><circle cx=\"412.0\" cy=\"128.0\" r=\"8.0\" class=\"f-fok\"/><circle cx=\"500.0\" cy=\"128.0\" r=\"8.0\" class=\"f-fok\"/><circle cx=\"544.0\" cy=\"128.0\" r=\"8.0\" class=\"f-fok\"/><text x=\"14.0\" y=\"188.0\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">wenn</text><text x=\"14.0\" y=\"208.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\">지금 · 앞으로</text><line x1=\"196.0\" y1=\"190.0\" x2=\"584.0\" y2=\"190.0\" class=\"f-ln\" marker-end=\"url(#als_wenn-ink)\"/><circle cx=\"528.0\" cy=\"190.0\" r=\"8.0\" class=\"f-fw\"/><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">Als ich Kind war, … · Immer wenn ich …, … · Wenn ich Zeit habe, …</text></svg></div><figcaption>als는 지난 일 한 번, wenn은 되풀이되는 일과 지금·앞으로의 일</figcaption></figure><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-first\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>과거</th><th>현재 · 미래</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>한 번 · 한 시기</td><td><strong>als</strong></td><td><strong>wenn</strong></td></tr><tr><td>여러 번 (되풀이)</td><td><strong>(immer) wenn</strong></td><td><strong>wenn</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Als</strong> ich nach Hause <strong>kam</strong>, war niemand da.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">과거 한 번</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">집에 왔을 때 아무도 없었어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Als</strong> ich zehn Jahre alt <strong>war</strong>, zogen wir nach Seoul.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">과거 한 시기</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">열 살 때 서울로 이사했어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>(Immer) wenn</strong> ich nach Hause <strong>kam</strong>, war meine Mutter da.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">과거 되풀이</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">집에 올 때마다 엄마가 계셨어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Wenn</strong> es <strong>regnet</strong>, nehme ich den Bus.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">현재 되풀이</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">비가 오면 버스를 타요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Wenn</strong> ich in Berlin <strong>bin</strong>, besuche ich dich.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">미래</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">베를린에 가면 너를 찾아갈게.</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-key\"><span class=\"co-badge \">과거 + 딱 한 번이면 als</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">als를 쓰는 경우는 하나뿐이에요 — 과거의 한 번 또는 한 시기. 나머지는 모두 wenn이에요.<br>과거의 되풀이를 분명히 하려면 immer wenn · jedes Mal, wenn을 써요.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">als · wenn</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> ____ ich ein Kind war, spielte ich gern Fußball.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ob</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wann</button></div><div class=\"qe\">과거의 한 시기 → als.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> ____ ich nach Hause komme, koche ich. <span class=\"qh\">(늘)</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ob</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Als</button></div><div class=\"qe\">현재 되풀이 → wenn.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> ____ wir gestern ankamen, regnete es.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Als</button></div><div class=\"qe\">과거의 한 번 → als.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> ____ du nächstes Jahr nach Korea kommst, zeige ich dir Seoul.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Wenn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앞으로의 일은 한 번뿐이어도 wenn이에요. als는 과거에 한 번 있었던 일에만 써요.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Immer ____ ich ihn besuchte, war er nicht zu Hause.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) wann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ob</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) als</button></div><div class=\"qe\">과거 되풀이 → (immer) wenn.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-C\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">C</span><h2>그 밖의 시간 접속사</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">während ~⁠하는 동안, bevor ~⁠하기 전에, nachdem ~⁠한 뒤에, seit ~⁠한 이후로, bis ~⁠할 때까지예요.</p></div></div><figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"fig-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 246\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"nachdem, bevor, während — 두 일의 순서\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"nachdem_bevor-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mki\"/></marker><marker id=\"nachdem_bevor-acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mka\"/></marker><marker id=\"nachdem_bevor-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mko\"/></marker><marker id=\"nachdem_bevor-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkn\"/></marker><marker id=\"nachdem_bevor-w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkw\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"14.0\" y=\"54.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">nachdem</text><rect x=\"196.0\" y=\"36.0\" width=\"140.0\" height=\"26.0\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-boxw\"/><text x=\"266.0\" y=\"54.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">nachdem 쪽 (먼저)</text><rect x=\"352.0\" y=\"36.0\" width=\"168.0\" height=\"26.0\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"436.0\" y=\"54.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">주문장 (나중)</text><text x=\"14.0\" y=\"130.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">bevor</text><rect x=\"196.0\" y=\"112.0\" width=\"140.0\" height=\"26.0\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"266.0\" y=\"130.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">주문장 (먼저)</text><rect x=\"352.0\" y=\"112.0\" width=\"168.0\" height=\"26.0\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-boxw\"/><text x=\"436.0\" y=\"130.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">bevor 쪽 (나중)</text><text x=\"14.0\" y=\"206.0\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">während</text><rect x=\"196.0\" y=\"173.0\" width=\"344.0\" height=\"26.0\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"368.0\" y=\"191.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">주문장</text><rect x=\"250.0\" y=\"203.0\" width=\"236.0\" height=\"26.0\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-boxw\"/><text x=\"368.0\" y=\"221.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">während 쪽 (같은 때)</text><line x1=\"196.0\" y1=\"232.0\" x2=\"560.0\" y2=\"232.0\" class=\"f-ln\" marker-end=\"url(#nachdem_bevor-ink)\"/><text x=\"570.0\" y=\"237.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\">시간</text></svg></div><figcaption>nachdem · bevor · während — 두 일의 순서</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" alt=\"Während ich koche, hört er Musik. 내가 요리하는 동안 그는 음악을 들어요.\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><div><span class=\"ph-de\"><strong>Während</strong> ich koche, hört er Musik.</span><span class=\"ph-ko\">내가 요리하는 동안 그는 음악을 들어요.</span></div></figcaption></figure><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>접속사</th><th>뜻</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>während</td><td>~⁠하는 동안 (동시에)</td><td><strong>Während</strong> ich koche, hört er Musik.</td></tr><tr><td>bevor</td><td>~⁠하기 전에</td><td><strong>Bevor</strong> ich ins Bett gehe, putze ich mir die Zähne.</td></tr><tr><td>nachdem</td><td>~⁠한 뒤에</td><td><strong>Nachdem</strong> ich gegessen habe, mache ich einen Spaziergang.</td></tr><tr><td>seit · seitdem</td><td>~⁠한 이래로 (지금까지)</td><td><strong>Seit</strong> ich in Seoul wohne, fahre ich viel U-Bahn.</td></tr><tr><td>bis</td><td>~⁠할 때까지</td><td>Warte hier, <strong>bis</strong> ich zurückkomme!</td></tr><tr><td>sobald</td><td>~⁠하자마자</td><td><strong>Sobald</strong> ich ankomme, rufe ich dich an.</td></tr><tr><td>solange</td><td>~⁠하는 동안 내내</td><td><strong>Solange</strong> du Fieber hast, bleibst du im Bett.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"dgm\"><div class=\"dgm-cap\">일이 일어나는 순서로 보기</div><div class=\"flow\"><div class=\"flow-node\">bevor ich esse<div class=\"flow-sub\">먹기 전</div></div><div>↓</div><div class=\"flow-node\">während ich esse<div class=\"flow-sub\">먹는 동안</div></div><div>↓</div><div class=\"flow-node\">sobald ich gegessen habe<div class=\"flow-sub\">먹자마자</div></div><div>↓</div><div class=\"flow-node\" style=\"background:var(--accent-bg);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);font-weight:600\">nachdem ich gegessen habe<div class=\"flow-sub\">먹은 뒤</div></div></div><div class=\"dgm-note\">bevor 절의 일은 주문장보다 나중, nachdem 절의 일은 주문장보다 먼저 일어나요.</div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-D\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">D</span><h2>시제 맞추기</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">nachdem 쪽은 먼저 끝난 일이라 시제를 한 단계 앞당겨요. 뒤 문장이 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">현재형<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">현재형</span>지금의 일, 습관, 가까운 미래를 말할 때 쓰는 동사 형태예요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich lerne Deutsch.</span></span></span>이면 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">현재완료<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">현재완료</span>말할 때 주로 쓰는 과거 시제예요. haben/sein + 과거분사로 만들어요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich habe Deutsch gelernt.</span></span></span>, <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">과거형<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">과거형</span>글과 이야기에서 주로 쓰는 과거 시제예요. 동사 하나로 과거를 나타내요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: ich lernte · ich ging · ich war</span></span></span>이면 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">과거완료<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">과거완료</span>과거의 어느 때보다 더 먼저 일어난 일을 말하는 시제예요. hatte/war + 과거분사.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: Ich hatte schon gegessen.</span></span></span>(26과)예요.</p></div></div><h3>nachdem — 한 단계 앞선 시제</h3><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>상황</th><th>nachdem 절</th><th>주문장</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>지금 · 늘 · 앞으로</td><td>현재완료 — Nachdem ich <strong>gegessen habe</strong>,</td><td>현재형 — <strong>gehe</strong> ich spazieren.</td></tr><tr><td>과거</td><td>과거완료 — Nachdem ich <strong>gegessen hatte</strong>,</td><td>과거형 — <strong>ging</strong> ich spazieren.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>seit — 지금도 계속되면 현재형</h3><p>seit 절의 일이 지금도 이어지면 seit 절과 주문장 모두 현재형이에요.</p><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Seit</strong> ich hier <strong>wohne</strong>, <strong>bin</strong> ich glücklich.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">여기 살기 시작한 뒤로 행복해요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Seit</strong> er Sport <strong>macht</strong>, <strong>fühlt</strong> er sich besser.</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">운동을 시작한 뒤로 그는 컨디션이 좋아요.</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">bevor와 während</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">bevor·während 절은 주문장과 같은 시제를 써요 — <strong>Bevor</strong> ich <strong>ging</strong>, <strong>rief</strong> ich sie an.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">시간 접속사와 시제</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> ____ ich schlafe, lese ich ein bisschen. <span class=\"qh\">자기 전에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Während</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Nachdem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">자기 전 → bevor.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Nachdem er die Arbeit beendet ____, ging er nach Hause.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) hatte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) war</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) hat</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) habe</button></div><div class=\"qe\">과거 → nachdem + 과거완료.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> ____ ich Deutsch lerne, verstehe ich mehr. <span class=\"qh\">독일어를 배운 뒤로 (지금도)</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Bis</button></div><div class=\"qe\">지금까지 이어짐 → seit + 현재형.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Ich warte, ____ du fertig bist. <span class=\"qh\">네가 끝날 때까지</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) sobald</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) bis</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) während</button></div><div class=\"qe\">~⁠할 때까지 → bis.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> ____ der Film beginnt, wird es dunkel. <span class=\"qh\">영화가 시작하자마자</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Sobald</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Solange</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Seit</button></div><div class=\"qe\">~⁠하자마자 → sobald.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> ____ das Baby schläft, mache ich die Hausarbeit. <span class=\"qh\">아기가 자는 동안</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Bis</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Nachdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Während</button></div><div class=\"qe\">동시 → während.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-E\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">E</span><h2>전치사 · 접속사 · 접속부사</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">같은 시간을 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span>(vor dem Essen), <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">접속사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">접속사</span>단어나 문장을 이어 주는 말이에요. 종류에 따라 어순이 달라져요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: und · aber · weil · dass</span></span></span>(bevor ich esse), <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">접속부사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">접속부사</span>앞 문장과 뜻을 이어 주는 부사예요. 첫 자리에 오면 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: deshalb · trotzdem · dann</span></span></span>(davor) 세 가지로 말할 수 있어요.</p></div></div><figure class=\"fig\"><div class=\"fig-scroll\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 262\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"같은 시간 관계를 전치사, 접속사, 접속부사로 말하면 동사 자리가 달라져요\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><defs><marker id=\"time_forms-ink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mki\"/></marker><marker id=\"time_forms-acc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mka\"/></marker><marker id=\"time_forms-ok\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mko\"/></marker><marker id=\"time_forms-no\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkn\"/></marker><marker id=\"time_forms-w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"f-mkw\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"12.0\" y=\"42.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">전치사</text><text x=\"12.0\" y=\"61.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\">+ 명사</text><rect x=\"104.0\" y=\"26.0\" width=\"128.3\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxo\"/><text x=\"168.1\" y=\"49.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-okt\" font-weight=\"700\">Vor dem Essen</text><rect x=\"238.3\" y=\"26.0\" width=\"74.2\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"275.4\" y=\"49.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">wasche</text><rect x=\"318.4\" y=\"26.0\" width=\"39.5\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"338.2\" y=\"49.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">ich</text><rect x=\"364.0\" y=\"26.0\" width=\"125.1\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"426.5\" y=\"49.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">mir die Hände.</text><text x=\"12.0\" y=\"116.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">접속사</text><text x=\"12.0\" y=\"135.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\">동사가 끝</text><rect x=\"104.0\" y=\"100.0\" width=\"59.2\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxo\"/><text x=\"133.6\" y=\"123.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-okt\" font-weight=\"700\">Bevor</text><rect x=\"169.2\" y=\"100.0\" width=\"39.5\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"189.0\" y=\"123.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">ich</text><rect x=\"214.8\" y=\"100.0\" width=\"56.7\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxw\"/><text x=\"243.1\" y=\"123.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-wt\" font-weight=\"700\">esse,</text><rect x=\"277.5\" y=\"100.0\" width=\"74.2\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"314.6\" y=\"123.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">wasche</text><rect x=\"357.7\" y=\"100.0\" width=\"39.5\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"377.4\" y=\"123.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">ich</text><rect x=\"403.2\" y=\"100.0\" width=\"125.1\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"465.7\" y=\"123.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">mir die Hände.</text><text x=\"12.0\" y=\"190.0\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">접속부사</text><text x=\"12.0\" y=\"209.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"f-m\">바로 뒤에 동사</text><rect x=\"104.0\" y=\"174.0\" width=\"215.7\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"211.9\" y=\"197.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">Ich wasche mir die Hände.</text><rect x=\"325.7\" y=\"174.0\" width=\"71.3\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxo\"/><text x=\"361.4\" y=\"197.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-okt\" font-weight=\"700\">Danach</text><rect x=\"403.0\" y=\"174.0\" width=\"51.6\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-boxa\"/><text x=\"428.8\" y=\"197.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-a\" font-weight=\"700\">esse</text><rect x=\"460.7\" y=\"174.0\" width=\"44.6\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-box\"/><text x=\"483.0\" y=\"197.4\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-t\" font-weight=\"700\">ich.</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"250.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-m\">초록 = 시간을 나타내는 말 · 파랑 = 동사 · 주황 = 종속절 끝의 동사</text></svg></div><figcaption>같은 시간 관계라도 형태에 따라 동사 자리가 달라요</figcaption></figure><p>같은 시간 관계를 세 가지 모양으로 말할 수 있어요. 뒤에 무엇이 오는지와 어순이 달라요.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>뜻</th><th>전치사 + 명사</th><th>종속접속사 + 문장 (동사 끝)</th><th>접속부사 (도치)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>~ 전에</td><td><strong>vor</strong> dem Essen</td><td><strong>bevor</strong> ich esse</td><td><strong>vorher</strong> · davor</td></tr><tr><td>~ 뒤에</td><td><strong>nach</strong> dem Essen</td><td><strong>nachdem</strong> ich gegessen habe</td><td><strong>danach</strong> · dann</td></tr><tr><td>~ 동안</td><td><strong>während</strong> des Essens</td><td><strong>während</strong> ich esse</td><td><strong>währenddessen</strong></td></tr><tr><td>~ 이래로</td><td><strong>seit</strong> dem Unfall</td><td><strong>seit</strong> ich hier wohne</td><td><strong>seitdem</strong></td></tr><tr><td>~⁠까지</td><td><strong>bis</strong> zum Abend</td><td><strong>bis</strong> ich komme</td><td><strong>bis dahin</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"exl\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Vor dem Essen</strong> wasche ich mir die Hände.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">전치사 + 3격</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">식사 전에 손을 씻어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Bevor ich esse</strong>, wasche ich mir die Hände.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">접속사 + 동사 끝</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">먹기 전에 손을 씻어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Ich wasche mir die Hände. <strong>Danach esse</strong> ich.</span><span class=\"exl-nt\">접속부사 + 도치</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">손을 씻어요. 그다음에 먹어요.</span></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-warn\"><span class=\"co-badge co-warn\">명사에는 전치사, 문장에는 접속사</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">✕ bevor dem Essen · ✕ vor ich esse — <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span> 앞은 vor, 문장 앞은 bevor예요.<br>nach/nachdem도 같아요 — nach dem Essen · nachdem ich gegessen habe.</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">전치사 · 접속사 · 접속부사</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> ____ der Arbeit gehe ich ins Fitnessstudio. <span class=\"qh\">일이 끝난 뒤</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Nach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Danach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Nachdem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">명사(der Arbeit) 앞 → 전치사 nach.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> ____ ich gearbeitet habe, gehe ich ins Fitnessstudio.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Nachdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Nach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Danach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Bevor</button></div><div class=\"qe\">문장 앞 → 접속사 nachdem.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Ich arbeite bis fünf. ____ gehe ich ins Fitnessstudio. <span class=\"qh\">그다음에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Nachdem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Nach</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Danach</button></div><div class=\"qe\">접속부사 + 도치.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> ____ des Unterrichts darf man nicht telefonieren. <span class=\"qh\">수업 동안</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Bevor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Während</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Solange</button></div><div class=\"qe\">명사 2격 앞 → 전치사 während.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> ____ der Prüfung lerne ich jeden Tag. <span class=\"qh\">시험 전에</span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Davor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Vor</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Vorher</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Bevor</button></div><div class=\"qe\">명사 앞 → 전치사 vor.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-F\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">F</span><h2>wann · wenn · als</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-easy\"><span class=\"co-badge co-easy\">쉽게 말하면</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">wann은 '언제?'라고 묻는 말이고, wenn과 als는 '~⁠할 때'예요.</p></div></div><p>모양이 비슷한 세 단어의 쓰임을 정리해요.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table class=\"t-left t-first\"><thead><tr><th>단어</th><th>종류</th><th>예</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>wann</td><td>의문사 — '언제'</td><td><strong>Wann</strong> kommst du? · Weißt du, <strong>wann</strong> er kommt?</td></tr><tr><td>wenn</td><td>종속접속사 — 조건 · 되풀이 · 미래의 때</td><td><strong>Wenn</strong> du kommst, koche ich.</td></tr><tr><td>als</td><td>종속접속사 — 과거의 한 번 / 비교의 '~⁠보다'</td><td><strong>Als</strong> ich kam, … · größer <strong>als</strong> ich (25과)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"callout callout-key\"><span class=\"co-badge \">간접의문문의 '언제'는 wann</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">'그가 언제 오는지'처럼 시간을 묻는 내용이면 wann이에요 — Ich weiß nicht, <strong>wann</strong> er kommt. (✕ wenn er kommt)</p></div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">wann · wenn · als</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Weißt du, ____ der Zug abfährt?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) wann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) wenn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ob</button></div><div class=\"qe\">시간을 묻는 간접의문문 → wann.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> ____ ich ihn letzte Woche traf, war er sehr müde.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ob</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wenn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">과거의 한 번 → als.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> ____ ich 2015 in Berlin war, habe ich ihn kennengelernt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Seit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wenn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">과거의 한 번 → als.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-G\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">G</span><h2>가장 많이 하는 실수</h2></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 1</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">과거의 한 번에 wenn을 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Wenn ich gestern nach Hause kam, war niemand da.<span class=\"tx-n\">되풀이처럼</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Als ich gestern nach Hause kam, war niemand da.<span class=\"tx-n\">어제 집에 왔을 때 아무도 없었어요</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">과거의 한 번·한 시기는 als예요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 2</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">미래에 als를 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Als ich morgen in Berlin bin, rufe ich dich an.<span class=\"tx-n\">과거 접속사</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Wenn ich morgen in Berlin bin, rufe ich dich an.<span class=\"tx-n\">내일 베를린에 가면 전화할게</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">현재와 미래는 언제나 wenn이에요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 3</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">조건에 wann을 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Wann ich Zeit habe, komme ich.<span class=\"tx-n\">의문사</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Wenn ich Zeit habe, komme ich.<span class=\"tx-n\">시간이 있으면 갈게</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\">wann은 '언제'를 묻는 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">의문사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">의문사</span>무엇·누구·언제처럼 모르는 부분을 묻는 말이에요. 독일어 의문사는 대부분 W로 시작해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: wer · was · wann · wo · wie · warum</span></span></span>예요.</div></div><div class=\"trap\"><div class=\"trap-head\"><span class=\"trap-badge\">실수 4</span><span class=\"trap-label\">Fehler</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px\">명사 앞에 bevor·nachdem을 써요</div><div class=\"trap-ex wrong\"><span style=\"color:var(--no);font-weight:700\">✕</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Bevor dem Essen … · Nachdem dem Kurs …<span class=\"tx-n\">접속사 + 명사</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-ex right\"><span style=\"color:var(--ok);font-weight:700\">✓</span><span class=\"tx-b\">Vor dem Essen … · Nach dem Kurs …<span class=\"tx-n\">전치사 + 명사</span></span></div><div class=\"trap-note\"><span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">명사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">명사</span>사람·동물·물건·장소·생각의 이름이 되는 말이에요. 독일어 명사는 첫 글자를 대문자로 써요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: der Tisch 책상 · die Liebe 사랑</span></span></span> 앞은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">전치사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">전치사</span>명사·대명사 앞에 붙어 장소·시간·이유 같은 관계를 나타내는 말이에요. 뒤에 올 격을 정해요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: mit dem Bus · für dich</span></span></span>, 문장 앞은 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">접속사<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">접속사</span>단어나 문장을 이어 주는 말이에요. 종류에 따라 어순이 달라져요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: und · aber · weil · dass</span></span></span>예요.</div></div><div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">바로 확인</span><span class=\"sub-title\">실수 피하기</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\"><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Als ich klein war, ich hatte einen Hund.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wann ich klein war, hatte ich einen Hund.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wenn ich klein war, hatte ich einen Hund.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Als ich klein war, hatte ich einen Hund.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">과거 한 시기 → als, 주문장은 동사 먼저.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ruf mich an, wenn du ankommst!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ruf mich an, wenn du kommst an!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ruf mich an, wann du ankommst!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ruf mich an, als du ankommst!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">미래 → wenn, 분리동사 붙어서 끝.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Danach dem Kurs gehen wir essen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Nach dem Kurs wir gehen essen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Nachdem dem Kurs gehen wir essen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Nach dem Kurs gehen wir essen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">명사 앞 → nach + 3격, 도치.</div></div><div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> 바른 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Als sie in Korea lebt, spricht sie gut Koreanisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Seit sie lebt in Korea, spricht sie gut Koreanisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Seit sie in Korea lebt, spricht sie gut Koreanisch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Seit sie in Korea lebt, sie spricht gut Koreanisch.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">seit + 현재형, 동사, 동사.</div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-H\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">H</span><h2>참고</h2></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">wenn …, dann</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">wenn 절 뒤에 dann을 넣어 '그러면'을 강조하기도 해요 — Wenn du Hilfe brauchst, <strong>dann</strong> ruf mich an.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">während의 또 다른 뜻</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">während는 '~⁠인 반면에'라는 대조의 뜻으로도 써요 — Er ist fleißig, <strong>während</strong> sein Bruder faul ist. 그는 부지런한 반면 그의 동생은 게을러요.</p></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">시간의 전치사 정리</span><div><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">um·am·im·in·vor·nach·seit·ab·bis는 7과, während·innerhalb는 16과를 다시 보면 좋아요.</p></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"sec-I\"><div class=\"sh\"><span class=\"sl\">I</span><h2>바로 쓰는 문장 · 일상 회화</h2></div><p>시간의 <span class=\"gt\" tabindex=\"0\">종속절<span class=\"gt-tip\"><span class=\"gt-t\">종속절</span>주절에 딸린 문장이에요. 활용된 동사가 맨 끝에 오고, 쉼표로 주절과 나눠요.<span class=\"gt-ex\">예: …, weil ich krank bin.</span></span></span>로 말하는 문장이에요.</p><div class=\"exl talk-l\"><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Als</strong> ich ein Kind <strong>war</strong>, wohnte ich in Busan.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">알스 이히 아인 킨트 바 보테 이히 인 부산</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">어렸을 때 부산에 살았어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Wenn</strong> ich Zeit <strong>habe</strong>, lese ich.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">벤 이히 차이트 하베 레제 이히</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">시간이 나면 책을 읽어요.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Bevor</strong> ich <strong>gehe</strong>, rufe ich dich an.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">베포어 이히 게에 루페 이히 디히 안</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">가기 전에 전화할게.</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\">Warte hier, <strong>bis</strong> ich <strong>komme</strong>!</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">바르테 히어 비스 이히 콤메</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">내가 올 때까지 여기서 기다려!</span></div><div class=\"exl-i\"><span class=\"exl-de\"><strong>Sobald</strong> ich <strong>ankomme</strong>, schreibe ich dir.</span><span class=\"talk-pr\">조발트 이히 안콤메 슈라이베 이히 디어</span><span class=\"exl-ko\">도착하자마자 메시지 보낼게.</span></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"summary\"><div class=\"summary-card\"><h2 class=\"sum-title\">이 과 정리</h2><div><div class=\"sum-li\">과거의 한 번·한 시기는 als, 되풀이·현재·미래는 wenn</div><div class=\"sum-li\">während 동시 · bevor ~ 전 · nachdem ~ 뒤 · seit ~ 이래 · bis ~⁠까지 · sobald ~⁠하자마자 · solange ~⁠하는 내내</div><div class=\"sum-li\">nachdem은 한 단계 앞선 시제, 지금도 이어지는 seit는 현재형</div><div class=\"sum-li\">명사 앞은 전치사(vor · nach · während · seit · bis zu), 문장 앞은 접속사, 접속부사는 도치(vorher · danach · seitdem)</div><div class=\"sum-li\">wann은 '언제'를 묻는 의문사, wenn은 조건·때, als는 과거 한 번·비교</div><div class=\"sum-li\">어순은 20과와 같아요 — 접속사 … 동사 끝, 앞에 오면 '동사, 동사'</div></div></div><div class=\"callout callout-note\" style=\"margin-top:20px\"><span class=\"co-badge co-note\">다음 ⏭ 28과</span><div>28과에서는 zu + 원형을 배워요 — Ich habe keine Lust, heute <strong>zu</strong> arbeiten.<br>um … zu · ohne … zu · statt … zu와 함께, dass 문장으로 바꾸는 법도 정리해요.</div></div></section><section id=\"solutions\" class=\"solutions\"><h2 class=\"sol-title\">Lösungen — 정답 모아보기</h2><div class=\"sol-grid\"><div><b>18–20과 복습</b>1. ich krank bin · 2. helfe ich dir · 3. wo er wohnt · 4. vor</div><div><b>als · wenn</b>1. Als · 2. Wenn · 3. Als · 4. Wenn · 5. wenn</div><div><b>시간 접속사와 시제</b>1. Bevor · 2. hatte · 3. Seit · 4. bis · 5. Sobald · 6. Während</div><div><b>전치사 · 접속사 · 접속부사</b>1. Nach · 2. Nachdem · 3. Danach · 4. Während · 5. Vor</div><div><b>wann · wenn · als</b>1. wann · 2. Als · 3. Als</div><div><b>실수 피하기</b>1. Als ich klein war, hatte ich einen Hund. · 2. Ruf mich an, wenn du ankommst! · 3. Nach dem Kurs gehen wir essen. · 4. Seit sie in Korea lebt, spricht sie gut Koreanisch.</div></div></section>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>\n"